ri a destra e a manca. Poi c'è Armando che vorrebbe essere come lo Steve McQueen di Vasco Rossi, orfano di padre, ne gestisce il negozio di antiquariato, ma corre dietro a qualsiasi gonna, fino a quando non incontra i jeans attillati di Anna che lo porta a cambiare..."},{"language":"en-US","title":"Taste of You","overview":"It depicts the lives of several groups of characters interacting at the beach of Forte dei Marmi during the mid-1980s."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dTMrGqUDRiAryAaXfD4lyejEUuH.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fm9KdIzzIuCsa97ETyeMrT7zMQh.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":249142,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"it-IT","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dTMrGqUDRiAryAaXfD4lyejEUuH.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/dTMrGqUDRiAryAaXfD4lyejEUuH.jpg","language":"it","width":2000,"height":3000},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dTMrGqUDRiAryAaXfD4lyejEUuH.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/dTMrGqUDRiAryAaXfD4lyejEUuH.jpg","language":"it","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lA3rYUiSDNsi6b9PDi5SVEOvtes.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/lA3rYUiSDNsi6b9PDi5SVEOvtes.jpg","language":"it","width":682,"height":1023},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/naS8iHpj0pZEMqd041xD5Xubm79.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/naS8iHpj0pZEMqd041xD5Xubm79.jpg","language":"it","width":1000,"height":1500},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/oZMjVJJFF705m6WFAyFbJh8UMrH.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/oZMjVJJFF705m6WFAyFbJh8UMrH.jpg","language":"it","width":1200,"height":1600}]},"en":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":